projects=[('3d-reconstruction','3D Shape Reconstruction from a Single Image','BACHELOR’S THESIS / DEEP LEARNING','2D → 3D','Reconstructing a 3D object from a single 2D image using deep learning.','I trained and compared multiple neural pipeline configurations to generate a 3D mesh for one object category, suitable for import into Blender and other 3D software.','Single-image reconstruction · Neural networks · 3D meshes'),('artist-classification','Artist Classification','COMPUTER VISION / ART','ART × AI','A multi-class convolutional neural network that predicts the author of a painting from an input image.','Built with TensorFlow and Keras, with data augmentation and regularization to improve generalization across artistic styles.','TensorFlow · Keras · CNN · Data augmentation'),('voterproof','VoterProof','PRIVACY / DATA','PUBLIC DATA.\nPRIVATE PEOPLE.','A privacy-preserving voter roll cleaning platform.','Designed a solution for detecting voter-roll anomalies without exposing personal data, using only public datasets. Implemented large-scale data visualization and cross-dataset matching to surface high-signal inconsistencies.','Data visualization · Cross-dataset matching · Privacy')]
